<h1>v<%= releaseVersion %></h1>

<p class='info-icon'>Be sure to keep up with the latest releases by subscribing to the
    <a href='http://www.mbtest.dev/feed'>ATOM feed</a>.</p>

<h2>New Features</h2>

<ul class='bullet-list'>
    <li>
        Added a <a href='http://www.mbtest.dev/docs/api/behaviors#behavior-chaos'><code>chaos</code>
        behavior</a> for probabilistic fault injection, useful for resilience and chaos engineering
        tests. It can replace a percentage of responses with an error status code
        (<code>errorRate</code> and <code>errorStatusCode</code>), delay a percentage of responses by
        a random amount of time (<code>latencyRate</code> and <code>maxLatencyMs</code>), or both.
    </li>
</ul>

<h2>Changes</h2>

<ul class='bullet-list'>
    <li>mountebank now requires node v20.19 or higher, up from v20. The newer minimum is needed for
        node's support of <code>require</code>ing ES modules, which <code>http-proxy-agent</code>
        relies on after its move to ESM</li>
    <li>Updated <code>http-proxy-agent</code> to v9, used when proxying through an
        <a href='http://www.mbtest.dev/docs/api/proxies'>http proxy</a> configured with the
        <code>HTTP_PROXY</code> environment variable. Proxying behavior is unchanged</li>
    <li>Updated <code>smtp-server</code> to v3.21.3 and <code>mailparser</code> to v3.14.2, used by
        <a href='http://www.mbtest.dev/docs/protocols/smtp'>smtp</a> imposters</li>
    <li>Updated <code>csv-parse</code> to v7.0.3, used by the
        <a href='http://www.mbtest.dev/docs/api/behaviors#behavior-lookup'><code>lookup</code>
        behavior</a></li>
    <li>Resolved a denial of service advisory in <code>body-parser</code>, which mountebank pulls in
        through <code>express</code>. <code>express</code> itself is unchanged at v5.1.0</li>
</ul>

